         fonts-noto-extra,
         fonts-nanum,
Description: font families of storytold's craft-fonts, from the distribution's packages
 storytold's craft-fonts (https://github.com/storytold/craft-fonts) is the font
 set that PhotoCraft and the other Craft apps are built and tested with. This
 metapackage installs the same families, as packaged fonts, instead of the
 files of that repository:
 .
  - Shippori Mincho (fonts-shippori-mincho)
  - BIZ UDPGothic and BIZ UDMincho (fonts-morisawa-bizud-gothic, -mincho)
  - Noto Sans CJK SC (fonts-noto-cjk)
  - Noto Sans Symbols 2 (fonts-noto-core)
  - Noto Sans Arabic, Thai, Georgian, Hebrew, Devanagari and Symbols
    (fonts-noto-extra)
  - NanumGothic (fonts-nanum)
 .
 It contains no files of its own.
